1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,740
San Marcos Kapitulo 14

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:10,160
Dwa paing aldaw, dumtengin ti Paskwa ken ti Fiesta titinapay nga awan libadorana.

3
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:19,320
Agsapsapol dagit ipangulwen apapadi ken mamaestro itilinteg itinalimed apanang tiliw ken panang papatayda ken Jesus.

4
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:24,160
Dita iranrana iti Fiesta, amangan rumswa tiriribok.

5
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:25,420
Kinunada

6
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:30,520
Adda idini Jesus ijebetanya itibalay ni Simon ng agkukutil.

7
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:40,120
Idimadama amangmangan, dimteng ti Maysa a babae anakaygem iti sa nga Botelia a Nardo, Maysa a Nangina a Bangbanglo.

8
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:45,500
Binuong na ti Botelia sana imbukbok ti Bangbanglo iti ulo ni Jesus.

9
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:52,360
Nakapuntot ti sumagmamano at attaong addasadyay kit kinunada iti Maysa ken Maysa.

10
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,360
Apaya sinayang na ti Bangbanglo.

11
00:00:55,420 --> 00:01:00,540
Nailako kong maitinasuro katalugasot adinaryo amaitid kadagiti na panglaw.

12
00:01:01,140 --> 00:01:04,100
Kasta unay itipanang babalawda iti babae.

13
00:01:04,740 --> 00:01:05,820
Ngayom kinunane Jesus.

14
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:07,680
Baybayan nyo.

15
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:10,200
Apay ababalawin nyo.

16
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:13,800
Nasaya at unay ti impaay na kanya.

17
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:18,400
Kankanayon nga addadagiti na panglaw itidenayo.

18
00:01:19,380 --> 00:01:22,860
Ket uray anya akan ito, matulungan nyo ida.

19
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:25,400
Ngayom saan akan kanayon?

20
00:01:25,420 --> 00:01:27,500
Ngayon nga addaak itiarpadyo.

21
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:30,260
Inaramid na ti kabailan na.

22
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:35,260
Sinapsapuan nantoy bagik ama isagana itipan na kaitanem.

23
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:38,660
Kinapudnuna kunak kada kayo.

24
00:01:39,940 --> 00:01:45,240
Sa dinuman iti entero alubong apakaikas kasabaan to tineimbag adamag.

25
00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:49,420
Masarsaritan to ti inaramid daytoy ababai.

26
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,760
Apakalaglagipan ken kwana.

27
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:54,760
Maysan ni Judas Iscariot.

28
00:01:55,420 --> 00:01:58,280
Ati, kadagiti sa nga pulo kait dua nga adalan.

29
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:04,660
Napan kadagiti panguluen apapadi tap nung mangitulag ayawat ni Jesus kadakwada.

30
00:02:05,460 --> 00:02:10,740
Naragsakanda anakang ngig itiimbagana, kait inkarida nga ikan iti kwarta.

31
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:17,220
Isot gapuna abinirbirukin ni Judas tigundaway na amang liput kinisus.

32
00:02:18,140 --> 00:02:21,880
Umunahidi nga aldaw ti fiesta titinapay nga wanlibadora na

33
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:24,740
kait maidaton dagit urbon akarnero.

34
00:02:25,420 --> 00:02:26,580
Pagpay iti Paskwa.

35
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:29,340
Sinaludso dagiti adalan ni Jesus.

36
00:02:35,580 --> 00:02:38,580
Imbaon ni Jesus ti dua kadagiti adalan na.

37
00:02:39,060 --> 00:02:39,560
Kinunana.

38
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:41,660
In kayo ija'y sudad.

39
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:47,320
Kat masabat yon to timay sa atao anakaawit iti sa nga karamba adanom.

40
00:02:48,500 --> 00:02:50,580
Suruten nyo iti balay aserkan na.

41
00:02:51,340 --> 00:02:53,440
Kat kunain yon to iti aking balay.

42
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:55,840
Kuna ti maestro.

43
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:59,440
Sa dino ti kwarto apanganan min to.

44
00:03:00,340 --> 00:03:03,080
Kadagiti adalan iti pangrabi iti Paskwa.

45
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:08,760
Ipakita nanto kada kayo timay sa analawa akwarto nga aking ngato.

46
00:03:09,820 --> 00:03:10,620
Naisagana.

47
00:03:11,420 --> 00:03:13,640
Ganadaan kadagiti masapsapol.

48
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:18,080
Sadyay tipangisaganaan nyo iti pangrabi itayo.

49
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:20,480
Pimanaw dagiti adalan na.

50
00:03:21,180 --> 00:03:22,320
Napanda iti syudad.

51
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:23,080
Kit nasarapan.

52
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:25,560
Nakanda amin kasimbaga ni Yesus.

53
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:29,580
Kit insagana dati pangrabi iti at pangrambak iti Paskwa.

54
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,140
Idirumabiin.

55
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:33,140
Dimteng sadyay ni Yesus.

56
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:35,820
Kit dagiti sangapulo kit doa nga adalan na.

57
00:03:36,420 --> 00:03:37,800
Kabayatan tipan nang anda.

58
00:03:38,300 --> 00:03:39,260
Kinunane Yesus.

59
00:03:40,020 --> 00:03:41,520
Ibagak kada kayo tipudno.

60
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:45,480
Maisa kada kayo amakilang lang lang kanyak ita.

61
00:03:45,980 --> 00:03:47,460
Timang lipot to kanyak.

62
00:03:48,220 --> 00:03:49,880
Nagliday dagiti adalan na.

63
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:53,040
Kit maisa maisa atinagsalutsod kin kuwana.

64
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:55,540
Siyak ka di daytakon kunam?

65
00:03:56,260 --> 00:03:57,520
Insumbat na Yesus.

66
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:04,720
Maisa kada kayo asangapulo kit doa amakisausausaw kanyak ititinapay iti malakungko.

67
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,360
Matay to ti anak ti tao.

68
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:10,500
Kas na isurat maipapanken kuwana.

69
00:04:11,860 --> 00:04:15,420
Ngem kaasintupay timang lipot iti anak ti tao.

70
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,840
Naimimbag pay kuma.

71
00:04:18,580 --> 00:04:21,500
Asaan anayan anak dayta atao.

72
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:24,060
Idimang manganda.

73
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:26,680
Nangalan ni Yesus ititinapay.

74
00:04:27,220 --> 00:04:29,440
Kit kalpasan tipanagyaman na iti Diyos.

75
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:32,520
Pinisi na sana inted kada kiti adalan na.

76
00:04:33,220 --> 00:04:34,040
Alaan nyo.

77
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,640
Kit kanin nyo.

78
00:04:36,700 --> 00:04:37,500
Daytoy tibagik.

79
00:04:38,700 --> 00:04:39,200
Kinunana.

80
00:04:39,700 --> 00:04:41,460
Nangalan ni Yesus itikopa.

81
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:44,680
Nagyaman iti Diyos sana inyawat kadakwada.

82
00:04:45,140 --> 00:04:46,340
Kit iminom daamin.

83
00:04:46,860 --> 00:04:47,500
Kinunana kadakwada.

84
00:04:48,780 --> 00:04:50,500
Daytoy titarak amamatalget.

85
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:53,100
Ititulag ti Diyos.

86
00:04:54,140 --> 00:04:55,040
Tidarak.

87
00:04:55,620 --> 00:04:59,000
Ama iparukpok na atpaay iti adu at at tao.

88
00:05:00,220 --> 00:05:03,020
Kinapudno na kunak kada kayo.

89
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:06,880
Diyakto uminumin iti arak ti ubas.

90
00:05:07,540 --> 00:05:12,280
Agingga iti daytangal daw na uminumak iti baru atubog ti ubas.

91
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:14,520
Itipagaryan ti Diyos.

92
00:05:15,140 --> 00:05:16,060
Kalpasan na.

93
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:18,540
Nagkantada iti may sangahim no.

94
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:21,460
Sa darimwar anapan ijebantay ulit.

95
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:23,800
Kinunana ni Yesus kadakwada.

96
00:05:24,620 --> 00:05:25,540
Dakay amin.

97
00:05:26,420 --> 00:05:27,420
Panawan dakto.

98
00:05:28,340 --> 00:05:30,180
Takunat ni nasantuan asurat.

99
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:33,420
Patayin to ti Diyos ti agpas pastor.

100
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:36,520
Ket mawarawaran to dagiti karnero.

101
00:05:38,180 --> 00:05:40,600
Ngayam kalpasan ti pan nakapagungar ko.

102
00:05:41,540 --> 00:05:42,640
Umununa akto.

103
00:05:43,180 --> 00:05:45,660
Ngayam dakayo amapan ijay Galilea.

104
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:48,180
Uray pamanaw danto amin.

105
00:05:49,020 --> 00:05:50,140
Insungbat ni Pedro.

106
00:05:50,140 --> 00:05:52,140
Dikan to panawan.

107
00:05:52,140 --> 00:05:55,140
Kinunana ni Yesus kenkwana.

108
00:05:55,140 --> 00:05:57,140
Laglag ipamdaytoy.

109
00:05:57,140 --> 00:06:03,140
Sakbay ti maikadoa pa nagtaraok ti kawitan iti daytoy arabii.

110
00:06:03,140 --> 00:06:06,140
Namitlunton ni imbagam.

111
00:06:06,140 --> 00:06:08,140
Adinak amam mo.

112
00:06:08,140 --> 00:06:11,140
Uray numatayak ama iraman kenka.

113
00:06:11,140 --> 00:06:14,140
Sipapasnek nga insungbat ni Pedro.

114
00:06:14,140 --> 00:06:17,140
Pulos adikan to paglikudan.

115
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:19,140
Kastamit ti kinunadag iti daduma.

116
00:06:19,140 --> 00:06:27,140
Dimteng ni Yesus ken dagiti adalan na, itimaysa adiso amanagan getsemani.

117
00:06:27,140 --> 00:06:29,140
Kinunana kadakwada.

118
00:06:29,140 --> 00:06:31,140
Agtugaw kayo ditoy.

119
00:06:31,140 --> 00:06:33,140
Bayat ti panagkararag ko.

120
00:06:33,140 --> 00:06:37,140
Inkuyog na da Pedro, Santiago, ken Juan.

121
00:06:37,140 --> 00:06:39,140
Nagdanag ken nariribukan.

122
00:06:39,140 --> 00:06:41,140
Arig na amatayak.

123
00:06:41,140 --> 00:06:44,140
Gapo itinakaro aladingit.

124
00:06:44,140 --> 00:06:46,140
Kinunana kadakwada.

125
00:06:46,140 --> 00:06:48,140
Agbati kayo ditoy.

126
00:06:48,140 --> 00:06:50,140
Ket agbantay kayo.

127
00:06:50,140 --> 00:06:53,140
Imadayo ba sit sa nagpakleb iti daga,

128
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:59,140
ket inkararag na anumabalin ko ma maliklikan na daytanga oras ti panagsagaba.

129
00:06:59,140 --> 00:07:00,140
Ama.

130
00:07:00,140 --> 00:07:01,140
Indawat na.

131
00:07:01,140 --> 00:07:03,140
Ama.

132
00:07:03,140 --> 00:07:05,140
Numabalin ko ma.

133
00:07:05,140 --> 00:07:09,140
Ilisinak iti daytoy ko pa ti panagsagaba.

134
00:07:09,140 --> 00:07:13,140
Ngayom saan atipagayatak ti maaramid.

135
00:07:13,140 --> 00:07:15,140
Nudiket tipagayatam.

136
00:07:15,140 --> 00:07:17,140
Idinagsubli ni Yesus,

137
00:07:17,140 --> 00:07:20,140
na danon na amatmaturog dagit italong adalan.

138
00:07:20,140 --> 00:07:22,140
Simon.

139
00:07:22,140 --> 00:07:24,140
Kinunana ken ni Pedro.

140
00:07:24,140 --> 00:07:26,140
Matmaturog ka kati.

141
00:07:26,140 --> 00:07:30,140
Di ka ayang makapagpuyat iti may sanga oras?

142
00:07:30,140 --> 00:07:32,140
Kinunana kadakwada.

143
00:07:32,140 --> 00:07:35,140
Agbuot ken agkararag kayo.

144
00:07:35,140 --> 00:07:38,140
Tap no saan kayo amat nag-itisulisog.

145
00:07:38,140 --> 00:07:40,140
Na to Diyo ti Espiritu,

146
00:07:40,140 --> 00:07:43,140
ngayom nakapoy tilasag.

147
00:07:43,140 --> 00:07:46,140
Imadayo man ni Yesus ket nagkararag.

148
00:07:46,140 --> 00:07:48,140
Inulit na iti dawat na.

149
00:07:48,140 --> 00:07:51,140
Nagsubli manin kadagiti adalan.

150
00:07:51,140 --> 00:07:53,140
Ket na danon na ida ang nakaturog,

151
00:07:53,140 --> 00:07:55,140
ta makaturturog dalaunay.

152
00:07:55,140 --> 00:07:58,140
Di daamuno anya ti ibagada ken kwana.

153
00:07:58,140 --> 00:08:01,140
Idi ka pamitlo ni Yesus ti agsubli.

154
00:08:01,140 --> 00:08:03,140
Kinunana kadakwada.

155
00:08:03,140 --> 00:08:05,140
Anya?

156
00:08:05,140 --> 00:08:09,140
Matmaturog ken agin ina na kayo paylaeng?

157
00:08:09,140 --> 00:08:11,140
Gusto daytan.

158
00:08:11,140 --> 00:08:13,140
Dimtengen ti oras.

159
00:08:13,140 --> 00:08:15,140
Kitaan niyo.

160
00:08:15,140 --> 00:08:19,140
Mayawaten ti anak ti tao kadagiti managpasol.

161
00:08:19,140 --> 00:08:22,140
Bumangon kayo taintayon.

162
00:08:22,140 --> 00:08:24,140
Kitaan niyo.

163
00:08:24,140 --> 00:08:27,140
At tuyen ti mang lipot kanya.

164
00:08:27,140 --> 00:08:29,140
Agsa sa upay laeng ni Yesus,

165
00:08:29,140 --> 00:08:31,140
idi sumangpet ni Judas,

166
00:08:31,140 --> 00:08:34,140
may sa kadagiti sangapulo ket dua nga adalan.

167
00:08:34,140 --> 00:08:37,140
Kimuyog ken kwana dagiti adu at at tao,

168
00:08:37,140 --> 00:08:41,140
anagtagi kampilan ken nagtagi pang-or.

169
00:08:41,140 --> 00:08:44,140
Imbaon ida dagiti pangulwen apapadi,

170
00:08:44,140 --> 00:08:47,140
dagiti ma-Maestro itilinteg,

171
00:08:47,140 --> 00:08:49,140
ken dagiti panglakayen.

172
00:08:49,140 --> 00:08:51,140
Sakbay iti papanda,

173
00:08:51,140 --> 00:08:56,140
inted ti mang lipot daytoy apagilasinan kadagiti kimuyog ken kwana.

174
00:08:56,140 --> 00:08:59,140
Dayjay agkak, iso ti sapsapulin nyo.

175
00:08:59,140 --> 00:09:03,140
Tiliwan ken ipanaw nyo kat gwardyaan nyo anaimbag.

176
00:09:03,140 --> 00:09:07,140
Ima sileg adagos ni Judas ken ni Yesus.

177
00:09:07,140 --> 00:09:09,140
Maestro!

178
00:09:09,140 --> 00:09:12,140
Kinunana sana inagkan itinamin adu.

179
00:09:12,140 --> 00:09:15,140
Tiniliw dan Yesus ket tinengelda analaing.

180
00:09:15,140 --> 00:09:19,140
Ngim inasot ti may sa kadagiti agtak-takder sa djay tibuneng na,

181
00:09:19,140 --> 00:09:22,140
sana tinagbat ti adipen ti kangatuan apadi,

182
00:09:22,140 --> 00:09:24,140
ket na pingasan ti lapayag na.

183
00:09:24,140 --> 00:09:27,140
Nagsao ni Yesus ket kinunana kadakwada,

184
00:09:27,140 --> 00:09:29,140
Tulisanak aya,

185
00:09:29,140 --> 00:09:34,140
tanagtagi kampilan ken nagtagi pang-or kayo nga umaymang tiliw kanya.

186
00:09:34,140 --> 00:09:38,140
Inal daw anakipul pula-pula kadakayo,

187
00:09:38,140 --> 00:09:40,140
ken nangisurusuro ak ijay templo,

188
00:09:40,140 --> 00:09:43,140
ket didak tiniliw.

189
00:09:43,140 --> 00:09:47,140
Ngim masapul amatumpal tinasantuan asurat.

190
00:09:47,140 --> 00:09:49,140
Nagtataray amin dagiti adalan,

191
00:09:49,140 --> 00:09:52,140
ket binaybayanda ni Yesus.

192
00:09:52,140 --> 00:09:56,140
Sumursurot kin Yesus ti may sangag tutubo alalaki,

193
00:09:56,140 --> 00:09:59,140
anaka kagay laing itilinen alupot.

194
00:09:59,140 --> 00:10:01,140
Tiniliw da.

195
00:10:01,140 --> 00:10:03,140
Ngim nakalapsot itikagay na,

196
00:10:03,140 --> 00:10:05,140
ket timaray alamulamo.

197
00:10:05,140 --> 00:10:08,140
Impanda ni Yesus itibalay ti kangatuan apadi,

198
00:10:08,140 --> 00:10:11,140
anag-uurnungan dagiti panguluen apapadi.

199
00:10:11,140 --> 00:10:15,140
Dagiti pang lakayen ken dagiti mamaestro itilinteg.

200
00:10:15,140 --> 00:10:20,140
Simurot ni Pedro nga adda asumarsaruno itiadayo.

201
00:10:20,140 --> 00:10:24,140
Simrek itiparaangan tibalay ti kangatuan apadi ket sa djay,

202
00:10:24,140 --> 00:10:27,140
nakitugaw ka dagiti gwardya ken nakiinudo.

203
00:10:27,140 --> 00:10:32,140
Nagbirbirok dagiti panguluen apapadi ken tinitero asan hidrin,

204
00:10:32,140 --> 00:10:35,140
ka dagiti pang maniknek ama ibusur ken Yesus,

205
00:10:35,140 --> 00:10:37,140
tapno papapatay da,

206
00:10:37,140 --> 00:10:39,140
ngim awan tinasarakan da.

207
00:10:39,140 --> 00:10:43,140
Ado tinagsao itiulbod amay kontra ken kwana,

208
00:10:43,140 --> 00:10:46,140
ngim saan anagtutunos dagiti pang maniknek da.

209
00:10:46,140 --> 00:10:49,140
Tim makder ti sumagmamano alalaki,

210
00:10:49,140 --> 00:10:52,140
ket kas toy itiulbod apang maniknek nga imbaga da.

211
00:10:52,140 --> 00:10:55,140
Nangigmingayin sa una,

212
00:10:55,140 --> 00:10:58,140
ribaik to day to yatimplo abinangon dagiti tattao,

213
00:10:58,140 --> 00:11:00,140
ket yunig titalungal daw,

214
00:11:00,140 --> 00:11:04,140
mang bangunak to iti sabali asaan nga aramit titao.

215
00:11:04,140 --> 00:11:05,140
Ura isu da,

216
00:11:05,140 --> 00:11:06,140
kas kasdina,

217
00:11:06,140 --> 00:11:10,140
kas kasdi asaan anagtutunos dagiti pang maniknek da.

218
00:11:10,140 --> 00:11:13,140
Tim makder ti kangatuan apadi itisangwanan da.

219
00:11:13,140 --> 00:11:18,140
Awan aya ti maisumbat mo ka dagiti ipampabasol dagiti itatatao?

220
00:11:18,140 --> 00:11:20,140
Sinaludsod na ken Yesus,

221
00:11:20,140 --> 00:11:22,140
ngim na gulimek Yesus,

222
00:11:22,140 --> 00:11:24,140
kit saan asim mong bat.

223
00:11:24,140 --> 00:11:28,140
Sika ka di ti Kristo nga anak tinasantuan na Diyos?

224
00:11:28,140 --> 00:11:31,140
Sinaludsod manin ti kangatuan apadi.

225
00:11:31,140 --> 00:11:33,140
Well, siyak!

226
00:11:33,140 --> 00:11:35,140
Insumbat Yesus,

227
00:11:35,140 --> 00:11:41,140
makita yun to ti anak ti tao as itutugaw iti makanawan ti man nakabalin amin.

228
00:11:41,140 --> 00:11:43,140
Makita yun to,

229
00:11:43,140 --> 00:11:46,140
nga umay ka dagiti ulip ti langit.

230
00:11:46,140 --> 00:11:49,140
Rinayab ti kangatuan apadi ti kagay na.

231
00:11:49,140 --> 00:11:53,140
Anya pa ila ti pakasapulan tayo ka dagiti saksi.

232
00:11:53,140 --> 00:11:54,140
Kinunana,

233
00:11:54,140 --> 00:11:56,140
nang ngagyon na kiti sa una,

234
00:11:56,140 --> 00:11:58,140
ama ikaniwas iti Diyos.

235
00:11:58,140 --> 00:12:00,140
Anya ti pangetengyo,

236
00:12:00,140 --> 00:12:03,140
sangsang kamaysa ti pangetengda.

237
00:12:03,140 --> 00:12:05,140
Nakabasol ni Yesus,

238
00:12:05,140 --> 00:12:08,140
kit masapol ang mapapatay.

239
00:12:08,140 --> 00:12:12,140
Sumagmamano ka dakwa dati ng tupra-tupra kin Yesus,

240
00:12:12,140 --> 00:12:14,140
kit inabungan dati rupa na,

241
00:12:14,140 --> 00:12:16,140
sada dinanog-danog.

242
00:12:16,140 --> 00:12:19,140
Pugtuan man no siya sino tinang tisnugten ka?

243
00:12:19,140 --> 00:12:21,140
Kinunada,

244
00:12:21,140 --> 00:12:22,140
kalpasan na,

245
00:12:22,140 --> 00:12:25,140
innala dagiti gwardiya sada ginagara iti tungpa.

246
00:12:25,140 --> 00:12:27,140
At dapay la ni Pedro itiparaangan,

247
00:12:27,140 --> 00:12:29,140
idi umasidig ti may isa babae,

248
00:12:29,140 --> 00:12:32,140
nga adipen ti kangatuan apadi.

249
00:12:32,140 --> 00:12:35,140
Idi makita na ni Pedro nga agin inudo,

250
00:12:35,140 --> 00:12:38,140
minimbingan na sa nakinuna.

251
00:12:38,140 --> 00:12:39,140
Uray sika,

252
00:12:39,140 --> 00:12:43,140
nakikadkadwa kametkin ni Yesus at aga Nazaret.

253
00:12:43,140 --> 00:12:44,140
Diyak amo,

254
00:12:44,140 --> 00:12:46,140
kandiyak maawatan ti ibagbagam.

255
00:12:46,140 --> 00:12:48,140
Inlibak ni Pedro,

256
00:12:48,140 --> 00:12:51,140
kit rimwar ang nagturong itiruangan,

257
00:12:51,140 --> 00:12:54,140
apag isumet ang nagtaraok ti may isa akawitan.

258
00:12:54,140 --> 00:12:57,140
Nakita manin sadyay ti babae nga adipen,

259
00:12:57,140 --> 00:13:00,140
kit inulit na kadagiti at dasadyay.

260
00:13:00,140 --> 00:13:03,140
May isa kadakwada day to yalalaki.

261
00:13:03,140 --> 00:13:06,140
Ngem naglibak manin ni Pedro,

262
00:13:06,140 --> 00:13:08,140
iti saan amabayag?

263
00:13:08,140 --> 00:13:11,140
Kinunamet kenkwana dagiti at dasadyay,

264
00:13:11,140 --> 00:13:16,140
Saan mo amalibak amay saka kadakwada tataga galilya kamet?

265
00:13:16,140 --> 00:13:21,140
Uray do saan naktidiyos no saan apudno ti ibagbagap?

266
00:13:21,140 --> 00:13:23,140
Insapatan ni Pedro,

267
00:13:23,140 --> 00:13:26,140
Diyak amam mo day tatao nga ibagbagayo.

268
00:13:26,140 --> 00:13:28,140
Pagamuan,

269
00:13:28,140 --> 00:13:30,140
nagtaraok manin ti kawitan

270
00:13:30,140 --> 00:13:32,140
kit nalagip ni Pedro ti kinunane

271
00:13:32,140 --> 00:13:34,140
isos kenkwana.

272
00:13:34,140 --> 00:13:35,140
Sakbay,

273
00:13:35,140 --> 00:13:38,140
ti maikadwa apa nagtaraok ti kawitan.

274
00:13:38,140 --> 00:13:40,140
Namitlun ton nga ibagam,

275
00:13:40,140 --> 00:13:42,140
atinak amam mo.

276
00:13:42,140 --> 00:13:44,140
Kit naganugog,

277
00:13:44,140 --> 00:13:46,140
gapu itiladingit na.

